213:1. **Global mobile typography and density:** The live article uses oversized type and desktop-like vertical spacing, producing roughly half the target’s information density. At `max-width: 480px`, set body copy to `15px/1.45`, display headings to `26px/1.08`, section headings to `24px/1.12`, metadata to `11px/1.35`, and labels to `10px` with `0.16em` letter-spacing. Reduce major vertical gaps from the current roughly `32-56px` to `12-20px`.
