215-2. **Mobile essay header:** The live header is approximately `96px` tall and uses a large logo plus four utility icons. The target has a compact `56px` article bar with the Signal/System wordmark on the left and one bordered Contents control on the right. Set `height: 56px; padding: 0 18px; background: #07182B; border-bottom: 1px solid #203653`; size the mark to `20px` and wordmark to `11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .18em`. Hide search, theme, lightning, and hamburger controls on this article viewport.
