223:6. **Contents navigation:** The target presents Contents as either a compact top-right button or a full-screen reading sheet with section timeline. The live build shows a detached bottom-right floating button that overlaps content. Remove the fixed button with `position: static` in the article and use the header control at `height: 30px; padding: 0 11px; border: 1px solid #3B567A; border-radius: 5px; background: #0B1B31; color: #E8EDF7; font-size: 11px`. For the opened sheet, use `position: fixed; inset: 56px 0 0; padding: 18px; background: #07182B`.
