231-10. **Color, borders, and glow system:** The live page is flatter and its purple accents are more diffuse than the reference. Use page background `#06172A`, raised plates `#091C33`, separators `#1D334E`, primary text `#F2EEE8`, secondary text `#AEB7C8`, and accent `#8A63FF`. Reserve glow for active controls only with `box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(125,79,255,.28)`; use crisp `1px` blue-gray borders and `6-8px` radii elsewhere.
